OL,3,GNEWSARescue to continue overnight for
OL,4,A'in distress' vessel carrying five in
OL,5,Athe Channel
OL,6,
OL,7,FRescue efforts for a vessel "in
OL,8,Fdistress" in the English Channel with
OL,9,Ffive people on board will continue
OL,10,Fovernight, the Maritime and Coastguard
OL,11,FAgency has said.
OL,13,FA helicopter, plane and lifeboats were
OL,14,Flaunched on Saturday evening south-west
OL,15,Fof Eddystone Lighthouse off Plymouth.
OL,17,FFurther details about the type of boat
OL,18,Finvolved and the nature of the
OL,19,Femergency have not been confirmed by
OL,20,Fofficials.
OL,23,APub: 29-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,344,340,200,160,0,100
